<title>GREECE: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN GREEK FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN GREEK FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Greek</p>
<p>first division after weekend matches:</p>
<p>8 - Christos Costis (AEK)</p>
<p>7 - Ilia Ivic (Olympiakos)</p>
<p>6 - Chrizstof Warzycha (Panathinaikos), Demis Nikolaides</p>
<p>(AEK)</p>
<p>5 - Alekos Alexandris (Olympiakos)</p>
<p>4- Costas Anastasiou (OFI), George Georgiadis</p>
<p>(Panathinaikos), Costas Franzeskos (OFI)</p>
<p>3 - Alexis Alexoudis (Panathinaikos), Nikos Liberopoulos</p>
<p>(Panathinaikos), Timour Ketspagia (AEK)</p>
</text>
